{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2023-06-27 16:40:00', 'title': 'MCCORMICK DECLARES $0.39 QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'HUNT VALLEY, MD. , JUNE 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MCCORMICK & COMPANY, INCORPORATED (NYSE:\xa0MKC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.39 PER SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCKS, PAYABLE JULY 24, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD JULY 10, 2023.'}